      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For Elias, focus on the banality of his despair rather than constant dramatic crises. Show the small, mundane tasks he performs while feeling completely disconnected—making coffee, going to work, etc.—to emphasize the pervasive hollowness. Explore his internal monologue to capture the exhaustion of trying to care when caring feels pointless. This quiet, persistent numbness often feels more honest than loud breakdowns.",
